{"id":"de427c699d9a6061","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-attaching-sphere.md","title":"Attaching Sphere","display":"df-attaching-sphere — Attaching Sphere","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-attaching-sphere","aliases":["58-df-attaching-sphere","Attaching Sphere"],"display":"df-attaching-sphere — Attaching Sphere","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-handle.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-attaching-sphere"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-attaching-sphere</span><span>Attaching Sphere</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-attaching-sphere — Attaching Sphere"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8ba6230066eaf8b\" href=\"?note=c8ba6230066eaf8b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-handle.md\">../batch14/58-df-handle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"890a8458fc69d8c7\" href=\"?note=890a8458fc69d8c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,A,\\phi,\\tau_M,\\tau_C,\\tau_{\\partial M}\\in V\">\\(M,A,\\phi,\\tau_M,\\tau_C,\\tau_{\\partial M}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\omega\">\\(k,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k}\">\\(C=S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k}\\)</span> is the attaching region and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{k-1}\\times\\{0\\}\\subseteq C\">\\(S^{k-1}\\times\\{0\\}\\subseteq C\\)</span> is its core sphere.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"890a8458fc69d8c7\" href=\"?note=890a8458fc69d8c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}attaching\\text{-}sphere}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S(A,\\phi,M,\\tau_M,\\tau_C,\\tau_{\\partial M},k,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nk\\leq n\n\\land \\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S\n\\bigl(\\phi,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k},\\tau_C,\\partial M,\\tau_{\\partial M}\\bigr)\n\\land A=\\phi\\bigl[S^{k-1}\\times\\{0\\}\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}attaching\\text{-}sphere}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S(A,\\phi,M,\\tau_M,\\tau_C,\\tau_{\\partial M},k,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nk\\leq n\n\\land \\mathrm{Manifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,n)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S\n\\bigl(\\phi,S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k},\\tau_C,\\partial M,\\tau_{\\partial M}\\bigr)\n\\land A=\\phi\\bigl[S^{k-1}\\times\\{0\\}\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is the image sphere in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial M\">\\(\\partial M\\)</span>, not the whole thickened attaching region.</li>\n<li>The handle predicate and attachment construction remain in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8ba6230066eaf8b\" href=\"?note=c8ba6230066eaf8b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-handle.md\">../batch14/58-df-handle.md</a>; framing is additional structure and is not silently built into this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Milnor, Morse Theory</li>\n<li>Gompf and Stipsicz, 4-Manifolds and Kirby Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-handle.md","status":"resolved","id":"c8ba6230066eaf8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-handle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df